<div class="alert alert-warning">
  <strong>The AI&rsquo;s script could not be used.</strong>
  <p class="mb-1"><%= script.failure_reason %>.</p>
  <p class="mb-2 small">
    The script did not match the expected shape or broke one of this app&rsquo;s rules: it must be close to the
    length you asked for, and it never uses therapy, healing, diagnosis or progress language or music cues.
    Write it again, or edit the template in the admin panel to tighten the instructions.
  </p>
  <%= render "intentions/write_button", intention: intention, label: "Retry",
             button_class: "btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm" %>
</div>
